  m_Name: GemMerchant_PostLevel3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  merchantTextLines:
  - "Heh. You\u2019re tougher than you look... but you\u2019re still blind to what
    really matters."
  - <wave a=.2 f=1.5>Artifacts</wave>. Relics of the old flame, power forged before
    the dark swallowed everything.
  - "Gather them all, and <slide a=.2>maybe</slide> you\u2019ll turn the tide. Wipe
    out the things that creep beyond the fire."
  - One lies ahead, past <shake a=.4>The Lost Greens</shake>.
  - "But I\u2019ve cracked open a path to <slide a=.2>The Sacred Temple</slide>.
    Choices, choices\u2026"
  - "<wave a=.2 f=1.5>Pick your road.</wave> But don\u2019t come crying if it eats
    you alive."
  showShopAfterDialog: 0
